00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:02.120
No tenemos cámaras

00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:03.400
in the private booths.

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:05.080
Do I have 'idiot'

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:06.680
written on my forehead?

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:12.640
Ma'am, with all due respect...

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:14.240
Remember that man

00:00:14.240 --> 00:00:15.600
who just walked out?

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:17.200
Your ex?

00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:19.800
Yes. If I raise my voice

00:00:19.920 --> 00:00:21.400
a single decibel,

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:23.200
pressing that button will be

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:24.440
the last thing you do

00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:26.040
as an employee here.

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:28.400
Ma'am,

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:30.280
but we don’t have cameras

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:31.400
in the private b...

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:32.440
Stop!

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:34.760
Okay.

00:00:45.920 --> 00:00:47.560
I've been waiting for you.

00:00:50.440 --> 00:00:51.960
No, this can't be.

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:57.640
I was expecting a redhead.
